                "text": "Here is Senate Republicans clapping as they passed their bill to take health care away from 17 million Americans. Their bill to shut down hospitals, shut down nursing homes, increase Americans' medical debt, take food assistance away from kids, and more.\n\nAll to pay for tax cuts for billionaires.\n\nThis isn\u2019t abstract policy. This is people\u2019s lives. This is a disgusting betrayal of the American people. \n\nBut this fight isn\u2019t over yet. We're going to do everything we can to fight this in the House.",
