                "text": "Joined @KSTPTV to discuss the Republican budget bill that President Trump just signed in to law.\n\u00a0\nHis \"One Big Beautiful Bill\" will:\n\u00a0\n\u27a1\ufe0f Kick 17 million Americans off their health insurance\n\u00a0\n\u27a1\ufe0f Force hospitals, clinics, and nursing homes to shut down\n\u00a0\n\u27a1\ufe0f Give massive tax breaks to billionaires and explode our national debt\n\u00a0\n\ud83d\udcfa Tune in to Channel 5 this Sunday @ 10AM",
