                "text": "Services at stake.\n\nBarriers to care.\n\nManufactured chaos. \n\nThis is what Trump\u2019s budget bill is doing to our health care clinics.\n\nGrateful to @ppnorthcentralstates for fighting harder than ever to keep providing accessible, affordable care to their patients. https://t.co/Llbb9IQLdp",
