                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Democratic Doctors Caucus stands with Planned Parenthood.\n\nAs Republicans in Congress try to force 200 of their clinics to close and put the health care of more than a million of their patients at risk, we're fighting to make sure everyone has the freedom and ability to access the health care they need and deserve.",
