                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are heading into a real health care crisis in our country. \n\nAt a time when Republicans are making the single largest cut to health care in our nation's history, putting hospitals and clinics into an impossible bind -- forcing them to cut services or even close entirely, kicking millions of Americans off their health insurance, increasing health insurance premiums, making it harder to access health care, don't forget their cruelly-named \"One Big Beautiful Bill\" ALSO makes it harder to go to medical school.\n\nThis is Trumpcare. And it will hurt all of us.\n\nhttps://t.co/Yg8fBUCDbu",
