                "text": "This morning I stood with House Democrats to make clear that we stand for protecting Americans' health care.\n\nIf Republicans want to bend the knee to Donald Trump and take health care away from millions of Americans and jack up everyone's health insurance premiums, they're going to have to do it alone.",
